 }
 gate_note: "r3 first recorded a pass; that run failed on links to mechanical, mechanical advanced, and ECE advanced surfaces not yet written, and r5 records the run after they landed"
 corrections: #[
  "the raw invariant that a phase margin above 45 degrees guarantees loop stability is restated: phase margin is a robustness heuristic for a nominal linear model",
